config XIAOMI_ANNIBALE_SLA
	tristate "Annibale SLA source candidate (development only)"
	depends on EXPERT && INET && NETFILTER && PROC_FS
	default n
	help
	  Same-family MiCode SLA source being qualified for Linux 6.6.
	  Mapping lifetime, packet synchronization and Annibale userspace
	  compatibility remain unqualified. Do not enable for device use.
	  This Kconfig is deliberately not sourced by production configurations.
